  {
   "id": "magin-the-rat-project-stories-127744@major-2022-04-21",
   "gameId": "magin-the-rat-project-stories-127744",
   "displayName": "Game status update and Publisher reveal!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2022-04-21T15:00:29.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "So folks! We haven't spoken in a while!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've been busy, but finally, we're ready to shed some light on the status of our game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "It's still early in the development stage, but we want to share some big news with You!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We're getting published by the one and only - Daedalic Entertainment!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That's right! We're developing Magin: The Rat Project Stories together with the great people of Daedalic!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "They love our ideas for the game and we're thrilled to be producing it with them. It's a pleasure to stand alongside Daedalic's games such as Deponia, Ken Follet's The Pillars of the Earth, Shadow Tactics, etc.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We'll keep you updated on the game's future and our plans. Hope You are all doing well!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The game will progressively get more and more highlights worldwide. We're not yet holding any big announcements with new promo assets and trailers. The game is being developed as we speak and we want to hit the market with some strong assets later - when we really have some shiny, juicy bits to show. For now, we stay lowkey, but You can expect some news about us attending events or making other moves :D WE'RE ALIVE AND DOING WELL!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "PS. We were devastated to hear the news regarding Ukraine and the start of the war. Hope none of You and your relatives and friends were victims of the aggression. No one should have to experience the horrors of war. We're hoping for the best possible solution to this situation and a peaceful future. We're sending our love to the people of Ukraine.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
